# Zig sources must stay LF on every platform. `zig fmt --check` treats
# CRLF as unformatted, and this repo has core.autocrlf=true (or the
# Windows CI runner's default) rewriting LF -> CRLF on checkout, which
# fails the format-check CI gate on Windows only (Linux/macOS check out
# verbatim). Pin these two extensions to LF so the checked-out bytes
# always match what `zig fmt` wrote, regardless of local git config.
*.zig text eol=lf
*.zon text eol=lf
